# Put a five-brick ceiling across Dive's small authored horizontal drift. The
# blocks exist in the collision buffer only; native PlayerHeadCollision would
# expose a failure by replacing one with temporary blank $23 and starting a
# block-object transaction.
WRITE_RAM8 0581 52
WRITE_RAM8 0582 52
WRITE_RAM8 0583 52
WRITE_RAM8 0584 52
WRITE_RAM8 0585 52
HOLD UP
HOLD B
WAIT 2
RELEASE B
RELEASE UP
